(c3baf0a892b193e23d6486ef40bd00c2e0297e272026-05-04T10:13:43ZÆ[8.7.0] Support for GITSHA1 digest function. (#29460)

Support for GITSHA1 digest function.

This is the algorithm used by git to hash blobs.

