### Description
This adds a needed `valuesMissing()` guard to fix rare crashes with
`IllegalStateException` when evaluating `TransitiveTargetKey` nodes
whose transitive closures include rules with aspects.

### Motivation
Fixes #29280

### Build API Changes

No

