(af6307bc6832d66cce772c5170961b4ff4521e482025-02-04T17:51:08Z‘[8.1.0] Configure `--run_under` target for the test exec platform (#25184)

With `--incompatible_bazel_test_exec_run_under`, the `--run_under`
target should be configured for the execution platform of the test
action, not the default execution platform of the test rule.

This is still not fully correct if `testing.ExecutionInfo` is used to
