Important changes:

  - Multiplex persistent workers can now use the JSON protocol.

This release contains contributions from many people at Google, as well as Alex Eagle, Austin Schuh, Benjamin Peterson, Cristian Hancila, Daniel Wagner-Hall, Denys Kurylenko, Ed Schouten, Finn Ball, George Gensure, Keith Smiley, Lauri Peltonen, Philipp Schrader, Ryan Beasley, Thi Doan, Timothy Klim, Ulf Adams, Vaidas Pilkauskas, wisechengyi, Xavier Bonaventura, Yannic Bonenberger, Yuval Kaplan, Yuval."12647ôD
