     Windows, test wrapper: fix broken integration test
   + f14d447cb56aee563f6e686b8f5b086a3bb55d47:
     Add whitelist file for starlark transitions
   + d99bc478db1f3414b4f6cd3dc14ca70aacf6b375:
     Update BUILD
