(7bb9e0fe91fc40d0b4537ecc805313fb0bc88a762018-09-14T10:15:51ZäJRelease 0.17.1 (2018-09-14)

Baseline: aa118ca818baf722aede0bc48d0a17584fa45b6e

Cherry picks:
