(037b9b93f33deaf8f33db2197b93a3e784c72fac2017-03-16T12:18:28Zù!Release 0.4.5 (2017-03-16)

Baseline: 2e689c29d5fc8a747216563235e905b1b62d63b0

Cherry picks:
   + a28b54033227d930672ec7f2714de52e5e0a67eb:
